[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4861.27, "timestamp": "01:21:01", "text": "当事情让我烦恼时，它们就无法离开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4863.03, "timestamp": "01:21:03", "text": "迅速离开。因为你知道当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.83, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "对一切都有抵触情绪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4868.39, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "text": "如果你有什么烦心事，那么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4870.31, "timestamp": "01:21:10", "text": "没有办法治愈它，因为疼痛……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4872.59, "timestamp": "01:21:12", "text": "遭受的痛苦就像那玩意儿一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4881.51, "timestamp": "01:21:21", "text": "所以我的精神健康状况只会越来越糟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4882.99, "timestamp": "01:21:22", "text": "我自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4885.7, "timestamp": "01:21:25", "text": "如果这样说你能理解的话，那就是关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4887.83, "timestamp": "01:21:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4892.149, "timestamp": "01:21:32", "text": "所以这就是我去健身房的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4895.79, "timestamp": "01:21:35", "text": "就像我不知道，它只是让你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4899.35, "timestamp": "01:21:39", "text": "脑中一片空白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4901.11, "timestamp": "01:21:41", "text": "你就会觉得，啊，我做了某件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4903.03, "timestamp": "01:21:43", "text": "今天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4904.87, "timestamp": "01:21:44", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.669, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "以积极的方式。是的。而且也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4914.39, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "text": "就像破旧的东西反而更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4917.55, "timestamp": "01:21:57", "text": "如果这说得通的话。"}]